{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03991","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 弓嗣初","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上序春晖丽，中园物候华。\n高才盛文雅，逸兴满烟霞。\n参差金谷树，皎镜碧塘沙。\n萧散林亭晚，倒载欲还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"弓嗣初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}